{"createdAt":1785081849907,"expiresAt":1785168249907,"key":"https://store.steampowered.com/api/appdetails?appids=1223820&filters=basic%2Cprice_overview%2Crelease_date%2Cplatforms%2Cdemos%2Cgenres&cc=MY&l=english","data":{"1223820":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Dryad","steam_appid":1223820,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","dlc":[4810640],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dryad is an island-building adventure where management and exploration intertwine. Grow your sanctuary, brave the unknown, and push back the darkness. You are the Wisp. Expand the Drifting Sanctuary, manage your flora, and protect your companion, the Dryad, from the relentless miasma.<br><br><strong>10 handcrafted chapters</strong> await, each introducing a unique biome, new mechanics, and an epic multi-phase boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Player's Sanctuary</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the Wisp.                          The Dryad is your companion  <br>   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1223820/extras/a4b4c1696937512ca6dea4734fb389c4.avif?t=1784828962\" width=67 height=76 /></span>                                                  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1223820/extras/2621af2ac3264ed77327f48dc55e052a.avif?t=1784828962\" width=79 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It falls to you to manage The Dryad's Sanctuary, a floating landmass that houses your plants. <br> The world has become enveloped in a thick, purple miasma that seemingly purges all life, twisting survivors into aggressive monsters.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1223820/extras/6f1ec7800062188cf55384e0a6e1fac1.poster.avif?t=1784828962\" width=1000 height=526 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1223820/extras/6f1ec7800062188cf55384e0a6e1fac1.webm?t=1784828962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1223820/extras/6f1ec7800062188cf55384e0a6e1fac1.mp4?t=1784828962\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At its heart, Dryad is built around a deliberate, two-phase structure across multiple handcrafted chapters:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Exploration Phase:</strong> Gather resources, find ancient relics, solve light environmental puzzles, and prepare your island for travel.  <br> <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1223820/extras/377df77a56213caaded1e22e76d1bb9d.poster.avif?t=1784828962\" width=1000 height=526 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1223820/extras/377df77a56213caaded1e22e76d1bb9d.webm?t=1784828962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1223820/extras/377df77a56213caaded1e22e76d1bb9d.mp4?t=1784828962\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1223820/extras/7c87fef3a3751e8c171cdacb38e2dbab.poster.avif?t=1784828962\" width=1000 height=526 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1223820/extras/7c87fef3a3751e8c171cdacb38e2dbab.webm?t=1784828962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1223820/extras/7c87fef3a3751e8c171cdacb38e2dbab.mp4?t=1784828962\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Travel Phase:</strong> Navigate environmental challenges, survive ceaseless enemy encounters, and face the pinnacle of the chapter: a multi-phased boss.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1223820/extras/fbd70b14b63c0f9be4cdb0519d6ab57e.poster.avif?t=1784828962\" width=1000 height=526 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1223820/extras/fbd70b14b63c0f9be4cdb0519d6ab57e.webm?t=1784828962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1223820/extras/fbd70b14b63c0f9be4cdb0519d6ab57e.mp4?t=1784828962\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1223820/extras/eff32367a3d43d357011d41070fd8a5b.poster.avif?t=1784828962\" width=1000 height=526 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1223820/extras/eff32367a3d43d357011d41070fd8a5b.webm?t=1784828962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1223820/extras/eff32367a3d43d357011d41070fd8a5b.mp4?t=1784828962\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dryad is an island-building adventure where management and exploration intertwine. Grow your sanctuary, brave the unknown, and push back the darkness. You are the Wisp. Expand the Drifting Sanctuary, manage your flora, and protect your companion, the Dryad, from the 